 "notes": [
  "All registers are holding registers: read with function 03, write with function 16.",
  "32-bit floats put the least significant word at the listed register (CDAB). The guide states this and its worked read example confirms it.",
  "Unavailable data reads as quiet NaN (float) or 0x8000 (16-bit integer) rather than an exception.",
  "Left out: status code (516) and security hash (518). They are 32-bit integers, and this guide only states the word order for 32-bit floats.",
  "The ppmw value depends on the oil type setting (771) or custom coefficients A/B.",
  "Integer copies: temperature and relative saturation are x10, water activity x1000.",
  "Left out: the 16-character identification strings at 7425-7449; use Read Device Identification (function 43/14) instead."
 ],
